item_name = "HP Potion"
description = "A restorative potion infused with carefully refined medicinal compounds that gradually replenish an Atomon's vitality.

Widely used by trainers during long expeditions, it is valued for its reliable healing properties and easy portability.

Though common, every bottle is carefully prepared to ensure it provides a safe and effective recovery in battle or while exploring the wild."
